<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>Speaking of references...<PG>
I believe you have seen the reference you obtained at the end of the scenario, 'The Culprit Who Led Her There.'<PG>
That phenomenon happened again, did it not? A person who should have been dead, walking.<PG>
Going by the order of events, when my mother arrived at the settlement, Sakura Niimura should already have been dead.<PG>
And yet she was moving, which means―<PG>
If I remember correctly, there was also a reference that explains that. I think it would be good to look at that one as well.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
